# labcommand_msgs/RequestSync TOPIC_MAP_BRICKS, CDR little endian. Derived by hand; see
# memory_status_le.hex. The Mac's mirror holds epoch 43, last applied map_bricks seq 12 (the values
# of map_bricks_delta_le.hex); this is its third request (seq 2). Covers: map_epoch repeating
# since_epoch; the message ends on a uint8 (49 bytes after the header).
00 01 00 00                 # encapsulation CDR_LE, options 0
04 00 00 00                 # pos 0   room_id length 4
6c 61 62 00                 # pos 4   "lab\0"
2b 00 00 00 00 00 00 00     # pos 8   map_epoch 43 (repeats since_epoch)
02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00     # pos 16  seq 2 (this client's request count)
8a 92 ed 68                 # pos 24  stamp.sec 1760400010
80 b2 e6 0e                 # pos 28  stamp.nanosec 250000000
2b 00 00 00 00 00 00 00     # pos 32  since_epoch 43
0c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00     # pos 40  since_seq 12
00                          # pos 48  topic TOPIC_MAP_BRICKS
